<div class="m3-overlays-root">
    <div id="scrim-dialog" class="m3-scrim m3-scrim-center" data-open="{controller.dialog_open}">
        <div id="scrim-dialog-backdrop" class="m3-scrim-backdrop" onclick="{controller.set_dialog_open(false)}"></div>
        <Dialog id="sync-dialog" class="m3-dialog-box" open="{controller.dialog_open}" title="테마 프리셋 동기화" confirm_label="적용" dismiss_label="취소" on_confirm="{controller.confirm_dialog()}" on_dismiss="{controller.set_dialog_open(false)}">
            <IconSettings slot="icon" />
            <span>현재 활성화된 디자인 테마의 CSS 변수 토큰을 하위 컴포넌트에 일괄 동기화합니다.</span>
        </Dialog>
    </div>

    <div id="scrim-bottom-sheet" class="m3-scrim m3-scrim-bottom" data-open="{controller.bottom_sheet_open}">
        <div id="scrim-bottom-sheet-backdrop" class="m3-scrim-backdrop" onclick="{controller.set_bottom_sheet_open(false)}"></div>
        <BottomSheet id="share-bottom-sheet" class="m3-bottom-sheet-box" open="{controller.bottom_sheet_open}" title="빠른 공유 및 내보내기" on_dismiss="{controller.set_bottom_sheet_open(false)}">
            <span>BottomSheet는 루트 뷰포트 하단에 앵커링되어 전체 콘텐츠 위에 딤 스크림과 함께 표시됩니다.</span>
            <div class="gallery-row">
                <Button id="copy-theme-tokens-btn" variant="filled" onclick="{controller.copy_theme_tokens()}">토큰 JSON 복사</Button>
                <Button variant="outlined" onclick="{controller.set_bottom_sheet_open(false)}">닫기</Button>
            </div>
        </BottomSheet>
    </div>

    <div id="scrim-side-sheet" class="m3-scrim m3-scrim-end" data-open="{controller.side_sheet_open}">
        <div id="scrim-side-sheet-backdrop" class="m3-scrim-backdrop" onclick="{controller.set_side_sheet_open(false)}"></div>
        <SideSheet id="inspector-side-sheet" class="m3-side-sheet-box" open="{controller.side_sheet_open}" title="속성 인스펙터 시트" position="end" on_dismiss="{controller.set_side_sheet_open(false)}">
            <span>SideSheet는 우측 화면 가장자리에 도킹되는 보조 속성 패널입니다.</span>
            <span class="gallery-note">M3·Tailwind 테마 토큰은 [data-theme] 순수 CSS 캐스케이드로 0-relayout 전환됩니다.</span>
            <div slot="actions" class="gallery-row">
                <Button variant="filled" onclick="{controller.set_side_sheet_open(false)}">완료</Button>
            </div>
        </SideSheet>
    </div>

    <div id="scrim-search-overlay" class="m3-scrim m3-scrim-top" data-open="{controller.search_overlay_open}">
        <div id="scrim-search-backdrop" class="m3-scrim-backdrop" onclick="{controller.close_search_overlay()}"></div>
        <div id="global-search-modal" class="m3-search-modal">
            <div class="m3-search-modal-head">
                <div class="m3-search-modal-input">
                    <SearchBar id="global-modal-searchbar" placeholder="컴포넌트 이름·카테고리 검색 (예: DatePicker, 캐러셀, Switch)" value="{controller.search_query}" oninput="{controller.on_search_input_cmd}" show_clear="{controller.search_open}" on_clear="{controller.clear_search()}" />
                </div>
                <Button id="close-search-overlay-btn" variant="tonal" onclick="{controller.close_search_overlay()}">닫기</Button>
            </div>
            <SearchView id="global-modal-searchview" class="m3-search-modal-list" open="{true}" title="M3 카탈로그 검색 결과 ({controller.search_query})">
                <List>
                    <for each="{row in controller.search_results}" key="{row.id}">
                        <ListItem headline="{row.name}" supporting="{row.summary}" trailing="{row.category}" onclick="{controller.open_search_item(row.doc_page)}" />
                    </for>
                    <empty>
                        <span class="gallery-note">일치하는 컴포넌트가 없습니다.</span>
                    </empty>
                </List>
            </SearchView>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="scrim-modal-drawer" class="m3-scrim m3-scrim-start" data-open="{controller.modal_drawer_open}">
        <div id="scrim-modal-drawer-backdrop" class="m3-scrim-backdrop" onclick="{controller.set_modal_drawer_open(false)}"></div>
        <NavigationDrawer id="modal-nav-drawer" class="m3-modal-drawer-box" title="모달 탐색 서랍">
            <NavigationDrawerItem id="modal-nav-drawer-item-0" label="프로젝트 루트" badge="4" selected="{controller.drawer_idx == 0}" onclick="{controller.pick_modal_drawer_item(0)}">
                <IconFolder slot="icon" class="m3-icon-sm" />
            </NavigationDrawerItem>
            <NavigationDrawerItem id="modal-nav-drawer-item-1" label="기본 컴포넌트 팩" selected="{controller.drawer_idx == 1}" onclick="{controller.pick_modal_drawer_item(1)}">
                <IconExtension slot="icon" class="m3-icon-sm" />
            </NavigationDrawerItem>
            <NavigationDrawerItem id="modal-nav-drawer-item-2" label="테마 프리셋 설정" selected="{controller.drawer_idx == 2}" onclick="{controller.pick_modal_drawer_item(2)}">
                <IconSettings slot="icon" class="m3-icon-sm" />
            </NavigationDrawerItem>
            <Button id="close-modal-drawer-btn" variant="outlined" onclick="{controller.set_modal_drawer_open(false)}">닫기</Button>
        </NavigationDrawer>
    </div>
</div>
